license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Research repository supporting an MSc thesis on the operational robustness of
  AI-based forensic image-classification and media-triage tools under clean,
  out-of-distribution, adversarial, and anti-forensic input conditions.
keywords:
  - digital forensics
  - forensic artificial intelligence
  - adversarial machine learning
  - anti-forensics
  - image classification
  - operational robustness
  - forensic tool validation
  - reproducible research
